| **GPU Selection Rationale** RTX 4090 remains the highest-demand consumer GPU on Vast.ai and RunPod in 2026. 24 GB VRAM serves Llama 3 70B at 4-bit quantization with headroom for concurrent sessions. The RTX 5090 carries premium cost and driver immaturity risk. Prosumer cards (L40S, RTX 6000 Ada) exceed Phase 1 CapEx budget with longer payback. Undervolted to 360W (80% power limit), the 4090 delivers 95%+ inference performance at a 20% electricity reduction. |
