| Professional — HIPAA-Ready | $850/mo | 1 dedicated GPU, PHI-safe architecture, signed BAA, HIPAA audit log package, quarterly access review, breach notification SOP, priority restart SLA (4 hr) | Medical/dental group, therapy practice, insurance office, mortgage company |
