| Enterprise — Managed Private AI | $2,200/mo | 2 dedicated GPUs + priority burst access, custom fine-tuned model on client data, RAG pipeline, API integration support, quarterly security review, DPA + BAA, 2-hr priority restart | Regional law firm, hospital group, financial services company |

