# **6. Go-To-Market — South Florida B2B**

The B2B sales motion is the entire game. Every marketplace optimization improves revenue at the margin. One B2B client at $750/month is worth more than 30 days of 60% marketplace utilization.

## **Target Prospect Profile**

| **Vertical** | **Pain Point** | **Your Solution** | **Decision Maker** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Law firm — 3–15 attorneys | Heppner ruling — privilege waiver risk from public AI | Private endpoint, DPA, zero third-party disclosure | Managing partner / IT director |
| Medical / dental group | HIPAA exposure sending notes to ChatGPT | Signed BAA, PHI never leaves network, audit trail | Practice owner / compliance officer |
| Mortgage / title company | NPI in loan docs — GLBA safeguard violation | Private LLM, data residency FL, DPA | Owner / COO |
| Insurance brokerage | Client PII in AI tools — regulatory exposure | Isolated endpoint, access controls, logging | Principal / compliance manager |
| Financial advisory RIA | SEC/FINRA data retention + privacy rules | Audit logs, 90-day retention, encrypted storage | Principal / CCO |
| Marketing agency — 10+ staff | Client IP and campaign data sent to public AI | Private endpoint for internal use, AUP, DPA | Agency owner / CEO |

## **Pre-Launch Sales Sequence (Weeks -4 to 0)**

| **Week** | **Action** | **Output** |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Week -4 | Form LLC. Open business bank account. Purchase domain. Build 1-page landing page with 3 pricing tiers and contact form. Brief headline: 'Private AI for South Florida Law Firms and Medical Practices.' | Legal entity + public presence |
| Week -3 | Identify 15 target prospects: Hollywood / Fort Lauderdale / Brickell corridor. Law firms via Florida Bar directory. Medical practices via county business records. Cold email + LinkedIn outreach. Lead with the Heppner ruling for law firms. Lead with HIPAA safe harbor for medical. | 15 prospects in pipeline |
| Week -2 | Follow-up calls. Goal: schedule 5 demos. Demo = 20 min screen share of the private endpoint. Show a prompt being processed, show the audit log, show the DPA. Close on intro pricing ($650/mo first 3 months). | 2 signed LOIs / agreements |
| Week -1 | Hardware assembled. vLLM deployed. Client endpoints configured and tested. TLS certificates issued. Per-client VLANs live. | Infrastructure ready |
| Day 1 | Client endpoints activated. Vast.ai + RunPod marketplace listings live at -15% below market to build reviews. Invoice Month 1 B2B clients. | Revenue begins Day 1 |

# **7. Risk Register**

| **Risk** | **Likelihood** | **Impact** | **Mitigation** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| ISP ToS violation — service termination | **High if not upgraded** | **Fatal** | Upgrade to Xfinity Business before hardware arrives. Non-negotiable. |
| Failure to pre-sell 2 B2B clients | **Medium** | **High — delays breakeven** | Begin outreach 4 weeks pre-launch. Abort condition: 0 clients by end of Month 2. |
| GPU hardware failure | **Medium** | **Medium** | $100–200/mo maintenance reserve. Refurb warranty required. Spare GPU sourced by Month 3. |
| Hurricane / multi-day power outage | **Medium (FL June-Nov)** | **High — temporary revenue loss** | Disclosed in MSA. No uptime SLA promised. Clients pre-informed of residential nature. |
| HOA enforcement action | **Low (no external footprint)** | **High if triggered** | Review CC&Rs before launch. No signage, no traffic, no noise externally. |
| Insurance coverage gap on hardware loss | **Low if disclosed** | **High** | Notify insurer before hardware arrives. Add commercial equipment rider. |
| HIPAA audit or client data breach | **Low if stack implemented** | **Fatal** | Full Layer 1–6 security stack. Written breach SOP. E&O insurance. BAA in place. |
| Marketplace utilization below 30% | **Medium (months 1–2)** | **Low — model survives on B2B** | B2B revenue covers opex. Marketplace is upside, not base case. |
| GPU market price compression | **Low (VRAM scarcity continues)** | **Medium** | 36-month depreciation model. 4090 demand remains strong through at least 2027. |

# **8. 30 / 60 / 90 Day Implementation Roadmap**

## **Days 1–30: Foundation**

- Form LLC (Florida) — $125 state filing + registered agent

- Hire attorney — draft BAA, DPA, MSA, AUP templates ($800–1,500 one-time)

- Notify homeowner's insurer — add commercial equipment rider

- Review HOA CC&R documents — confirm no commercial use prohibition

- Upgrade to Xfinity Business Gigabit Extra — obtain static IP

- Hire licensed electrician — install dedicated 20A 240V circuit to hosting room

- Acquire UniFi Dream Machine Pro + managed switch — configure VLAN architecture

- Build landing page — domain, pricing tiers, contact form

- Begin B2B outreach — 15 prospects, Heppner angle for law firms, HIPAA angle for medical

- Order hardware (BOM above) — source refurb RTX 4090 with warranty

## **Days 31–60: Go-Live**

- Assemble and burn-in hardware — 48-hour stress test (FurMark + inference load)

- Deploy vLLM + NGINX + TLS — test all endpoints, verify zero prompt retention

- Configure LUKS disk encryption — verify boot process and key management

- Deploy Grafana Loki audit logging — confirm structured log output per request

- Configure WireGuard VPN — lock down all admin/OOB access

- Close minimum 2 B2B clients — sign agreements, collect Month 1 payment

- Activate client VLANs — test inter-VLAN isolation (penetration check)

- List on Vast.ai + RunPod at -15% market rate — pre-load top 6 model weights

- Issue Month 1 B2B invoices — billing live

- Gate G2 check: marketplace utilization >= 35% by Day 60

## **Days 61–90: Optimize and Gate**

- Deliver first monthly access report to each B2B client

- Review 30-day P&L: actual NCF vs model — identify variance drivers

- Raise marketplace pricing to market rate (after minimum 10 positive reviews)

- Activate dynamic peak/off-peak pricing on marketplace listings

- Pursue 3rd B2B client — target Medical / HIPAA tier at $850/mo

- Evaluate GPU undervolt tuning — confirm electricity savings realized

- Assess Phase 2 trigger: if G3 passed (3 clients, NCF positive), source GPU 5+6

- Document all security controls — create client-facing compliance summary (1-page)

- Quarterly API key rotation for all B2B clients

