| **Gate** | **Month** | **Condition to Pass** | **Unlocks** | **Abort Condition** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| G1 — Pre-launch | M0 | 2 B2B clients signed. ISP upgraded. Circuit installed. LLC formed. BAA template ready. | Full 4-GPU build proceeds | 0 clients: delay hardware order |
| G2 — PoC validation | M3 | Marketplace util >= 35% sustained 30 days. B2B clients paying. | Begin outreach for 3rd client. Begin marketplace rate increase. | < 20% util: pricing or quality diagnosis required |
